sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as Browser (Next.js)
    participant A as Django API
    participant R as Redis (blacklist/cache)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over B,A: 1. Login
    B->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/login/ {username, password}
    A->>DB: verify credentials (throttle: auth 10/min)
    A-->>B: 200 + Set-Cookie wc_access (5 min, httpOnly, SameSite=Lax)<br/>Set-Cookie wc_refresh (24 h, httpOnly)
    Note over B: tokens are NEVER in localStorage

    Note over B,A: 2. Authenticated calls
    B->>A: GET /api/v1/users/me/ (credentials: include)
    A->>A: JWT from cookie → user
    A-->>B: 200 {user}

    Note over B,A: 3. Unsafe methods (POST/PUT/DELETE)
    B->>A: GET /api/v1/auth/csrf/
    A-->>B: Set-Cookie csrftoken
    B->>A: POST … + X-CSRFToken: <csrftoken><br/>(double-submit check)

    Note over B,A: 4. Access-token expiry
    B->>A: GET … → 401
    B->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/token/refresh/ (EMPTY body)
    A->>R: check old refresh token not blacklisted
    A->>R: blacklist old, rotate new refresh
    A-->>B: 200 + fresh wc_access / wc_refresh
    B->>A: retry original call

    Note over B,A: 5. Logout
    B->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/logout/
    A->>R: blacklist current refresh
    A-->>B: cookies cleared

    Note over A,DB: Non-browser clients (public API, CLI)<br/>keep using Bearer tokens from<br/>/api/v1/token/ + personal API tokens (OPS-2)
